# The console reads these at BUILD time (Vite inlines VITE_* into the bundle).
# Both are public by design — the anon key is the same one confirm.html ships with,
# and RLS plus the RPC grants are the protection. Never put SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
# here: it bypasses RLS, and anything in this file ends up in a file on the internet.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
